      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.freeipa.org/page/Main_Page&#34;&gt;FreeIPA&lt;/a&gt; is an integrated security information management solution combining Linux (Fedora), Fedora Directory Server, MIT Kerberos, NTP, DNS.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It consists of a web interface and command-line administration tools. Currently it supports identity management with plans to support policy and auditing management.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
